<title>USA: TBS picks Scientific-Atlanta digital system.</title>
<headline>TBS picks Scientific-Atlanta digital system.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scientific-Atlanta Inc said on Wednesday that Turner Broadcasting System Inc has picked its digital video compression system for use in delivering TBS programming to Latin America.</p>
<p>The company did not provide terms of the deal.</p>
<p>Scientific-Atlanta provides technology to the cable, broadcast, business, and home television markets in more than 130 countries.</p>
</text>
